                "title": "Egg and Dart Knobset, Brass Accents D05-K568-EGD",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K568-EGD, Egg and Dart Knobset - The Egg and Dart Knobset has beautiful detailing along both the edge of the knob and the backplate. It is available in a wide array of finishes. The Traditional Egg and Dart Latchset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It is 2-1/2 inches wide and 8-3/8 inches tall. Made by Brass Accents, the D05-K568-EGD Egg and Dart Plate with Matching Knob will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
